WEBVTT

00:00:00.450 --> 00:00:03.600
Let's embrace...

00:00:03.600 --> 00:00:05.980
Being together like this...

00:00:05.980 --> 00:00:09.900
...is something I'll never forget!

00:00:09.900 --> 00:00:13.310
Forever...

00:00:13.320 --> 00:00:15.830
...under this sky...

00:00:15.830 --> 00:00:18.440
...we'll walk together!

00:00:19.840 --> 00:00:21.130
In this beauty...

00:00:21.130 --> 00:00:22.240
...that I'm dreaming...

00:00:22.250 --> 00:00:23.290
...the world's just a...

00:00:23.300 --> 00:00:24.420
...merry, merry-go-round!

00:00:24.670 --> 00:00:26.010
With more dreaming...

00:00:26.020 --> 00:00:27.080
...and more loving...

00:00:27.100 --> 00:00:28.170
...my heart is a...

00:00:28.180 --> 00:00:29.390
...merry, merry-go-round!

00:00:29.390 --> 00:00:30.690
Luvly, merry-go-round!

00:00:30.900 --> 00:00:33.080
Getting ready for a good morning...

00:00:33.100 --> 00:00:35.760
...I say 'good morning', then I chat and run.

00:00:35.790 --> 00:00:37.940
A lovely life every day...

00:00:37.950 --> 00:00:40.640
...is my wish for you, my sweet heart!

00:00:40.640 --> 00:00:42.740
A, B, C, D, E, F, G!

00:00:42.750 --> 00:00:45.390
A lack of vitamins isn't healthy.

00:00:45.410 --> 00:00:47.520
1, 2, 3, 4, 5, 6, 7!

00:00:47.540 --> 00:00:50.600
Bring along your favorite and let's go!

00:00:53.080 --> 00:00:56.460
Rolling rainbow star!

00:00:56.470 --> 00:00:58.830
If you go there...

00:00:58.840 --> 00:01:02.830
...you'll surely find it!

00:01:02.840 --> 00:01:06.210
Lovely roller coaster!

00:01:06.210 --> 00:01:08.690
Under this sky...

00:01:08.700 --> 00:01:11.340
...its a total pleasure!

00:01:13.610 --> 00:01:16.060
Being together like this...

00:01:16.060 --> 00:01:19.590
...is something I'll never forget!

00:01:23.280 --> 00:01:25.780
Under this sky...

00:01:25.780 --> 00:01:28.270
...we'll walk together!

00:01:40.070 --> 00:01:42.260
You need to fall right, at least.

00:01:44.540 --> 00:01:47.060
Yukihime-san, you're too serious.

00:01:47.360 --> 00:01:48.280
Serious?

00:01:49.040 --> 00:01:52.810
Okay, next time I'll do it really serious if you want.

00:01:59.930 --> 00:02:01.610
I lose.

00:02:04.850 --> 00:02:05.780
Sorry.

00:02:05.810 --> 00:02:06.580
Are you OK?

00:02:08.600 --> 00:02:10.040
You're really good, Ryuu-kun.

00:02:10.520 --> 00:02:11.920
What are you doing, Minami-san?

00:02:12.520 --> 00:02:14.170
Class isn't over.

00:02:15.780 --> 00:02:16.750
I know that!

00:02:32.000 --> 00:02:34.860
Eight months since we entered DDS

00:02:34.880 --> 00:02:38.570
and now, at last, we're given a mission
to investigate a girl's dorm!

00:02:40.430 --> 00:02:43.240
Kinta, you a pervert or something?

00:02:43.680 --> 00:02:46.120
A man! I am a man!

00:02:46.810 --> 00:02:49.660
Aah, I'm so glad I wanted to be a detective!

00:02:50.480 --> 00:02:54.540
Look at that beautiful, sparkling, pure
white glitter near the window!

00:02:55.270 --> 00:02:56.590
Beautiful!

00:02:57.070 --> 00:02:58.880
Snow white!

00:03:00.180 --> 00:03:01.060
Man, I'm embarrassed...

00:03:01.860 --> 00:03:05.300
We came here to investigate a
report of an underwear thief!

00:03:06.450 --> 00:03:07.300
Let's go.

00:03:07.830 --> 00:03:09.390
Hey, you don't need to hurry so much.

00:03:09.830 --> 00:03:11.480
Let's watch a bit more, Kyuu.

00:03:24.550 --> 00:03:26.490
Wow, I feel better.

00:03:32.350 --> 00:03:33.250
What?

00:03:49.540 --> 00:03:50.680
What's going on?

00:03:50.700 --> 00:03:52.720
Pervert!

00:03:57.170 --> 00:03:59.190
You can't get away-now.

00:04:03.590 --> 00:04:04.780
Where is the pervert?

00:04:04.930 --> 00:04:05.700
Where?

00:04:07.220 --> 00:04:08.910
Wait!

00:04:12.100 --> 00:04:12.950
Are you OK?

00:04:15.560 --> 00:04:16.170
A girl?

00:04:16.900 --> 00:04:18.630
Ouch...

00:04:21.230 --> 00:04:22.500
Have seen you somewhere?

00:04:23.190 --> 00:04:24.140
What's all this commotion?

00:04:25.530 --> 00:04:26.840
Katagiri-sense

00:04:26.870 --> 00:04:27.760
An intruder!

00:04:27.780 --> 00:04:29.550
Are you the pervert everybody's talking about?

00:04:30.240 --> 00:04:32.720
She's the one who was peeking into the shower room!

00:04:32.950 --> 00:04:36.270
Jeez. How did you sneak into DDS?

00:04:36.670 --> 00:04:39.230
I'm not a pervert, how rude!

00:04:39.670 --> 00:04:40.690
It's a misunderstanding.

00:04:40.710 --> 00:04:45.900
I saw somebody I knew, so I just
thought I'd ask for directions.

00:04:46.180 --> 00:04:47.110
Somebody you knew?

00:04:47.470 --> 00:04:51.030
It seems like there's been a misunderstanding,

00:04:51.060 --> 00:04:54.620
but she's a new student in the A-Class, Touya Kumiko-san.

00:04:56.440 --> 00:04:58.370
Touya ... Touya ...

00:04:59.150 --> 00:05:00.000
I know that...

00:05:03.650 --> 00:05:08.630
I decided to do an image change and become a detective!

00:05:10.990 --> 00:05:12.680
I can't believe it.

00:05:16.710 --> 00:05:18.600
Anyway, on a different subject,

00:05:19.250 --> 00:05:24.230
Kinta and Kyuu were mistaken for perverts
at a women's dorm and were arrested.

00:05:25.720 --> 00:05:30.030
We sent them to infiltrate a women's dorm
where underwear thefts were occurring,

00:05:30.600 --> 00:05:33.160
but it seems that they were thought
to be the criminals themselves...

00:05:33.520 --> 00:05:35.660
Man, we can't do anything about it...

00:05:36.180 --> 00:05:41.380
Minami-san, would the three of you
go along to clear things up?

00:05:42.320 --> 00:05:43.710
Yes, understood.

00:05:55.620 --> 00:05:58.230
The three of us... was this three, huh.

00:05:58.830 --> 00:06:02.690
I thought it was gonna be

00:06:02.710 --> 00:06:04.520
What? I'm not good enough?

00:06:04.800 --> 00:06:05.610
No.

00:06:07.630 --> 00:06:09.190
Let's get along!

00:06:18.930 --> 00:06:23.370
Yamada town. Yamada town. Please get out on the left side

00:06:32.120 --> 00:06:33.090
It started to rain.

00:06:33.830 --> 00:06:36.350
I didn't bring an umbrella.

00:06:36.830 --> 00:06:40.980
You didn't check the weather report?

00:06:41.000 --> 00:06:42.600
And you call yourself a detective?

00:06:43.540 --> 00:06:49.230
Remembering when it was clear and when
was raining helps with alibi investigation too.

00:06:52.430 --> 00:06:53.780
Touya-san, what about you?

00:06:54.350 --> 00:06:56.370
Of course I did~

00:06:56.810 --> 00:07:00.580
Looks like she's a better detective than you.

00:07:14.410 --> 00:07:19.060
We went to Kanuiza to save you, didn't we?

00:07:19.370 --> 00:07:21.480
This is different!

00:07:22.210 --> 00:07:23.850
Why are they different?

00:07:28.090 --> 00:07:30.280
Umm...

00:07:29.840 --> 00:07:31.150
Oh my...

00:07:31.470 --> 00:07:35.240
To find three such beautiful women in
a place like this, what a coincidence.

00:07:35.470 --> 00:07:36.660
Saburomaru-san!

00:07:36.760 --> 00:07:38.990
Are you heading somewhere?

00:07:39.020 --> 00:07:42.500
If so, The I'll be happy to escort you.

00:07:42.600 --> 00:07:43.370
We'll Pass.

00:07:43.810 --> 00:07:45.210
My, how harsh...

00:07:45.230 --> 00:07:46.500
You're in the way! Get away from us!

00:07:56.950 --> 00:07:58.510
You meanie.

00:07:59.830 --> 00:08:02.270
I thought that the farthest car back would be open...

00:08:03.120 --> 00:08:05.230
Don't press up against me so much, Minami-san!

00:08:07.750 --> 00:08:08.900
What sorrow!

00:08:22.600 --> 00:08:25.330
Umm... a pervert?

00:08:25.560 --> 00:08:26.830
That's right!

00:08:27.610 --> 00:08:32.130
To have DDS students mistaken for
perverts, that's just too much.

00:08:32.150 --> 00:08:34.050
Actually I wonder if it was really a mistake.

00:08:34.060 --> 00:08:35.340
What do you mean?

00:08:35.360 --> 00:08:40.260
They may screw up a lot and have a generally unhealthy
interest in women, but they are NOT perverts.

00:08:41.410 --> 00:08:43.020
I dunno.

00:08:43.040 --> 00:08:44.430
What?

00:08:48.380 --> 00:08:50.980
I said they aren't!

00:09:01.850 --> 00:09:04.370
Chinkugiwa. Chinkugiwa.

00:09:08.760 --> 00:09:09.760
I'm soaked!

00:09:09.930 --> 00:09:11.010
Are you okay?

00:09:29.630 --> 00:09:31.270
<i>Again?</i>

00:09:32.590 --> 00:09:33.900
<i>I have to do something,</i>

00:09:34.960 --> 00:09:38.400
<i>but we're almost there.</i>

00:09:58.280 --> 00:09:59.300
Touya-san?

00:09:59.320 --> 00:10:00.260
What's wrong?

00:10:03.700 --> 00:10:04.760
A pervert!

00:10:04.790 --> 00:10:05.970
There's a train pervert!

00:10:06.000 --> 00:10:06.970
Excuse me, make way.

00:10:07.330 --> 00:10:08.310
I've caught a train pervert!

00:10:08.830 --> 00:10:09.600
A train pervert?

00:10:17.260 --> 00:10:18.740
It's not me!

00:10:18.760 --> 00:10:19.700
It's not, I swear!

00:10:19.840 --> 00:10:25.910
Yamanagidai. This is the last stop Yamanagidai. Please 
 be careful not to leave anything behind.

00:10:23.890 --> 00:10:24.700
Hey!

00:10:29.850 --> 00:10:30.830
Wait!

00:10:31.770 --> 00:10:34.790
I didn't molest you!

00:10:35.570 --> 00:10:36.630
We know!

00:10:36.650 --> 00:10:38.010
We know, so get out of the way!

00:10:38.030 --> 00:10:39.840
You really, really believe me?

00:10:39.860 --> 00:10:40.880
Just get out of the way!

00:10:44.280 --> 00:10:46.470
My honor has been shattered.

00:10:46.910 --> 00:10:47.930
Where did he go?

00:10:47.950 --> 00:10:50.680
I'm sure he's in this crowd somewhere.

00:10:51.580 --> 00:10:54.610
Jeez. Why didn't you say something earlier?

00:10:55.040 --> 00:10:56.320
And you call yourself a DDS student?

00:10:57.460 --> 00:11:04.490
I... joined DDS because I was tired of being
the old me and wanted to change,

00:11:04.510 --> 00:11:06.990
but I knew it, I can't.

00:11:09.140 --> 00:11:10.910
Everyone screws up sometimes.

00:11:11.850 --> 00:11:13.670
Anyway, let's find the guy now.

00:11:15.770 --> 00:11:16.250
Yes.

00:11:39.630 --> 00:11:40.230
There he is.

00:11:40.260 --> 00:11:41.150
It's him!

00:11:47.100 --> 00:11:48.780
Excuse me, you there.

00:11:49.520 --> 00:11:50.740
Please wait.

00:11:53.100 --> 00:11:54.000
Yes?

00:11:55.480 --> 00:11:57.170
Do you need something from me?

00:11:59.030 --> 00:12:05.010
You molested this girl on the Aogawa
line, just now, didn't you?

00:12:07.370 --> 00:12:08.300
What?

00:12:08.330 --> 00:12:10.260
You seem to think I'm somebody else.

00:12:10.540 --> 00:12:15.940
But I saw that watch on your right
hand and your green shirt.

00:12:16.960 --> 00:12:18.310
Even then...

00:12:19.000 --> 00:12:24.700
It was so crowded, are you sure it isn't a mistake?

00:12:25.050 --> 00:12:27.200
I don't make mistakes like that.

00:12:27.220 --> 00:12:29.780
She has photographic memory.

00:12:30.180 --> 00:12:32.490
Photographic memory?

00:12:33.100 --> 00:12:34.790
Who are you?

00:12:35.400 --> 00:12:36.210
We're...

00:12:44.030 --> 00:12:45.260
DDS.

00:12:45.780 --> 00:12:48.090
Please come with us to the station office.

00:12:55.530 --> 00:13:00.840
They suddenly stopped me and accused
me of molesting her on the train.

00:13:01.780 --> 00:13:04.470
I have no idea what they're talking about.

00:13:06.460 --> 00:13:08.560
It's true that just her recollection isn't enough,

00:13:08.580 --> 00:13:11.100
even if you are DDS students.

00:13:11.420 --> 00:13:16.230
No way, I remember everything as
I see it, there's no doubt about it.

00:13:16.260 --> 00:13:17.780
He was the one who did it.

00:13:18.260 --> 00:13:20.160
As you see it?

00:13:20.180 --> 00:13:22.780
You're deciding on this from my shirt and my watch

00:13:24.600 --> 00:13:25.740
Alright then, that's that.

00:13:27.020 --> 00:13:27.540
OK?

00:13:28.810 --> 00:13:31.580
I'm very sorry sir.

00:13:32.150 --> 00:13:35.050
No, I'm just glad we cleared that mistake up.

00:13:35.860 --> 00:13:39.380
Everyone makes mistakes.

00:13:39.860 --> 00:13:42.590
I'm sorry, but it's not a mistake!

00:13:42.950 --> 00:13:45.510
You're still saying that?

00:13:45.540 --> 00:13:48.730
Can we please just stop this already?

00:13:49.460 --> 00:13:53.650
Minami-san, we don't have any proof right now,

00:13:53.670 --> 00:13:56.980
and as long as we don't catch him in
the act it'll be difficult to arrest him.

00:13:57.410 --> 00:14:02.040
I know that, but...

00:14:00.210 --> 00:14:00.620
To just let a train molester go.

00:14:03.470 --> 00:14:08.330
A lot of people have gotten in trouble
because of mistakes lately.

00:14:08.350 --> 00:14:14.710
As long as you have no proof, it's more likely that you'll
be dragged into court for making false accusations.

00:14:15.020 --> 00:14:18.170
But he had that watch!

00:14:18.940 --> 00:14:23.340
My talent is recognized by the National
Institute for Talent Development.

00:14:24.740 --> 00:14:26.510
Even SO...

00:14:27.830 --> 00:14:32.310
And what's more, I saw the back of the guy
as he was running away, and it was him!

00:14:32.920 --> 00:14:34.230
Back?

00:14:34.750 --> 00:14:35.230
Yes.

00:14:36.300 --> 00:14:40.110
All businessmen look about the same from the back.

00:14:40.550 --> 00:14:42.280
But it was you.

00:14:42.510 --> 00:14:44.200
You're getting way too persistent!

00:14:57.190 --> 00:15:04.130
It was right after we left Higashifujiwara and
continued until we got to Yamagamidai.

00:15:05.240 --> 00:15:11.520
At first he was just touching my butt, and then...

00:15:12.920 --> 00:15:13.850
Touya-san...

00:15:14.880 --> 00:15:18.570
You want to be a detective, don't you?
Then don't whimper like that!

00:15:19.510 --> 00:15:22.280
If you can't be clear about it, that's just what he wants!

00:15:22.300 --> 00:15:23.740
Right!

00:15:26.890 --> 00:15:28.990
Then look at this.

00:15:29.720 --> 00:15:38.000
According to her, that molester started
his foul act after Higashifujiwara, right?

00:15:38.980 --> 00:15:43.260
But I wasn't on the train then.

00:15:43.860 --> 00:15:46.630
I couldn't have done it!

00:15:52.830 --> 00:15:55.640
It seems you guys have the wrong person after all.

00:15:56.330 --> 00:15:59.230
I am extremely sorry.

00:16:00.000 --> 00:16:02.820
No, I'm just glad that the misunderstanding
has been cleared up.

00:16:04.590 --> 00:16:09.570
But I guess DDS doesn't quite live up to its name, huh.

00:16:10.970 --> 00:16:14.870
You're just lucky that I'm such an understanding guy,

00:16:14.890 --> 00:16:17.710
otherwise it might get you in legal trouble.

00:16:20.480 --> 00:16:22.380
Well then, I'll be going.

00:16:35.120 --> 00:16:36.270
Wait a second.

00:16:38.670 --> 00:16:39.730
Something else?

00:16:40.840 --> 00:16:43.190
Tell me one last thing, if you would.

00:16:44.510 --> 00:16:45.530
Yes?

00:16:45.930 --> 00:16:50.620
You were on the same car as us, weren't you?

00:16:52.060 --> 00:16:56.450
Yes I heard you shout.

00:16:56.980 --> 00:17:00.580
Then since you got on at the Shinfujiwara station,

00:17:00.610 --> 00:17:04.960
you shouldn't have been able to move
about in those crowded cars.

00:17:07.150 --> 00:17:13.560
That means that you got on at
the last door on the last car.

00:17:14.620 --> 00:17:15.720
Yes, well...

00:17:16.460 --> 00:17:20.480
I like riding in the last car on trains.

00:17:20.530 --> 00:17:23.490
Then there's something strange.

00:17:24.170 --> 00:17:24.860
Huh?

00:17:25.590 --> 00:17:29.530
It was absolutely pouring outside then.

00:17:31.260 --> 00:17:36.080
The Shinfujiwara station you said you got
has no roof covering the last car,

00:17:36.100 --> 00:17:38.500
and you should've been soaked.

00:17:40.560 --> 00:17:43.880
Even if you did like it, would you go through the trouble

00:17:43.900 --> 00:17:46.630
of putting up an umbrella to go just
a few steps into the last car?

00:17:46.860 --> 00:17:49.130
I can if I want to!

00:17:49.160 --> 00:17:53.430
Then let me ask this: that umbrella
of yours is still covered,

00:17:53.450 --> 00:17:57.470
isn't wet, and doesn't seem to have been used, does it?

00:17:58.620 --> 00:18:02.690
It's strange that you wouldn't use an umbrella there.

00:18:02.710 --> 00:18:04.810
Stop this nonsense!

00:18:04.840 --> 00:18:07.940
I got on at Shinfujiwara Station!

00:18:07.970 --> 00:18:09.690
This ticket proves it!

00:18:10.510 --> 00:18:13.490
I can explain the trick behind that ticket easily.

00:18:14.760 --> 00:18:15.700
What do you mean?

00:18:16.180 --> 00:18:22.080
Basically, you bought that ticket before it started

00:18:22.810 --> 00:18:23.710
What?

00:18:24.690 --> 00:18:29.800
You bought a ticket at Shinfujiwara Station
early in the morning, and got on the train.

00:18:30.820 --> 00:18:36.760
And then from Yamanaka Station to Yamagamidai Station,
you scouted the train for a target to molest.

00:18:38.290 --> 00:18:45.020
When you started going after Touya-san, you'd already
ridden back and forth on the train several times.

00:18:47.630 --> 00:18:50.650
No, I just bought this ticket a while ago!

00:18:50.680 --> 00:18:51.570
See?

00:18:51.590 --> 00:18:52.700
He lied again!

00:18:53.220 --> 00:18:55.030
Sir, you heard that, right?

00:18:55.470 --> 00:18:56.530
Yes.

00:18:57.520 --> 00:19:03.500
When a ticket is inserted into a turnstile the
time is recorded onto the magnetic strip.

00:19:03.900 --> 00:19:08.250
A bit of investigation will reveal what
time you got onto the train instantly.

00:19:09.820 --> 00:19:16.090
The only reasons you'd be riding the Aogawa Line during
rush are pick pocketing or molestation!

00:19:17.270 --> 00:19:18.190
Am I wrong?

00:19:21.070 --> 00:19:21.900
I see

00:19:22.110 --> 00:19:24.350
From the techniques he's using, he must do this regularly.

00:19:24.380 --> 00:19:25.100
Yes.

00:19:30.760 --> 00:19:31.650
Dammit!

00:19:32.430 --> 00:19:33.110
Wait!

00:19:33.130 --> 00:19:34.110
Call the police!

00:19:34.140 --> 00:19:34.700
Yes!

00:19:34.720 --> 00:19:35.320
Let's go!

00:19:35.340 --> 00:19:35.780
Yes!

00:19:38.310 --> 00:19:39.370
Wait!

00:19:44.100 --> 00:19:45.290
Wait!

00:19:45.940 --> 00:19:47.040
I said wait!

00:19:47.610 --> 00:19:48.920
Yuk hira-san!

00:19:49.230 --> 00:19:50.090
You two, circle around him!

00:19:56.320 --> 00:19:57.340
Wait!

00:20:03.040 --> 00:20:04.140
Got you!

00:20:06.500 --> 00:20:07.400
Wait!

00:20:12.970 --> 00:20:13.990
Watch out!

00:20:14.010 --> 00:20:14.690
Touya-san!

00:20:16.640 --> 00:20:17.610
No!

00:20:19.640 --> 00:20:20.950
Get out of the way!

00:20:26.650 --> 00:20:28.540
Wh-what?

00:20:31.320 --> 00:20:32.250
I did it?

00:20:32.610 --> 00:20:33.760
I'm sorry!

00:20:35.030 --> 00:20:36.510
Are you OK?

00:20:37.660 --> 00:20:38.970
What should I do?

00:20:40.150 --> 00:20:42.470
Touya-san, what was that?

00:20:43.230 --> 00:20:44.070
Aikidou?

00:20:44.290 --> 00:20:48.980
Ah yes. My family runs an Aikidou Dojo,

00:20:49.340 --> 00:20:53.150
and I've been training in it since I was a kid,

00:20:54.760 --> 00:20:57.860
but I'm not supposed to use a technique
like that except against another student.

00:20:58.970 --> 00:21:03.660
lf my father finds out he'll lock
me in the storehouse again.

00:21:05.270 --> 00:21:06.620
What should i do?

00:21:06.640 --> 00:21:08.790
She looks like a Kogal.

00:21:08.810 --> 00:21:10.210
She's got a personality like a kitten

00:21:10.820 --> 00:21:12.920
and she's actually an...

00:21:12.940 --> 00:21:14.500
Aikidou master?

00:21:15.110 --> 00:21:18.090
Anyway, we know she's not normal.

00:21:18.110 --> 00:21:18.930
Yeah...

00:21:31.340 --> 00:21:32.110
Well then, members of DDS.

00:21:37.010 --> 00:21:38.400
Take care.

00:21:42.560 --> 00:21:44.660
I guess things are taken care of, then.

00:21:44.660 --> 00:21:44.860
Yeah

00:21:50.860 --> 00:21:55.130
That was cool the way you broke him down at the end.

00:21:59.200 --> 00:22:05.390
I was impressed with how you connected the closed
umbrella and the lack of a roof at the platform.

00:22:06.450 --> 00:22:09.140
Photographic memory is a powerful weapon, isn't it?

00:22:09.750 --> 00:22:13.230
And Touya-san, I was impressed with
you finished off the guy at the end.

00:22:13.790 --> 00:22:14.770
No.

00:22:14.800 --> 00:22:18.740
You know, we actually make a pretty good team.

00:22:18.760 --> 00:22:19.820
Really?

00:22:19.840 --> 00:22:23.990
Why don't we join together and become DDS's lady trio

00:22:24.310 --> 00:22:26.700
That's nice! We teammates can decide!

00:22:27.270 --> 00:22:32.830
Umm.. thank you for helping?

00:22:40.820 --> 00:22:45.640
Well then, want to go get a snack to
celebrate the founding of our team?

00:22:45.660 --> 00:22:47.600
Sure! Let's go! Let's go!

00:22:47.620 --> 00:22:49.310
Um, but...

00:22:49.330 --> 00:22:50.100
The pervert...

00:22:50.660 --> 00:22:52.230
Don't worry about that!

00:22:52.250 --> 00:22:54.150
Yeah it's over?

00:22:54.170 --> 00:22:54.690
Right?

00:23:00.970 --> 00:23:02.900
Damn you, pervert!

00:23:03.760 --> 00:23:07.780
Never do this again!

00:23:08.810 --> 00:23:11.660
I'm telling you!

00:23:11.980 --> 00:23:14.330
You still gonna keep saying that?

00:23:14.900 --> 00:23:18.750
No, seriously, we're DDS students...

00:23:19.190 --> 00:23:23.510
DDT? Alrighty then, if you want a DDT that's fine!

00:23:23.530 --> 00:23:25.680
That's not what I said!

00:23:26.330 --> 00:23:27.350
Oh no.

00:23:30.370 --> 00:23:31.520
Um...

00:23:32.420 --> 00:23:34.350
Strawberry's the best!

00:23:35.040 --> 00:23:37.020
I like peppermint!

00:23:38.090 --> 00:23:39.770
Save us, people!

00:23:39.340 --> 00:23:40.980
I'm going die!

00:23:45.590 --> 00:23:47.420
THOSE THINGS REFLECTED IN YOUR EYES...

00:23:47.420 --> 00:23:49.760
...ARE DESTINED TO FALL APART.

00:23:49.760 --> 00:23:52.430
NO! NO! NO! NO! BELIEVING IN THAT...

00:23:52.430 --> 00:23:54.090
...IS UP TO YOU.

00:23:54.090 --> 00:23:56.100
LOVE AND KINDNESS...

00:23:56.100 --> 00:23:58.390
...OFTEN STEM FROM SELFISHNESS.

00:23:58.390 --> 00:24:00.930
IF YOU STILL PURSUE THEM...

00:24:00.930 --> 00:24:02.730
...YOU'RE JUST WANDERING AIMLESSLY.

00:24:03.440 --> 00:24:06.980
IT CAN SEEM BOTH FAR AND NEAR...

00:24:06.980 --> 00:24:10.610
THAT PLACE WHERE LOVE LIVES.

00:24:11.650 --> 00:24:13.700
THE UNSEEN STORY...

00:24:13.700 --> 00:24:16.120
...IS A MESSAGE TO YOU.

00:24:16.120 --> 00:24:18.240
YOU'RE USED TO WAITING FOR IT...

00:24:18.240 --> 00:24:19.790
...WITHOUT GIVING UP!

00:24:20.250 --> 00:24:22.460
THE UNSEEN STORY...

00:24:22.460 --> 00:24:24.670
EVEN WHEN WE'RE LOST...

00:24:25.170 --> 00:24:26.880
...CAN'T WE BELIEVE...

00:24:26.880 --> 00:24:30.380
...THAT WE CAN STILL DO IT?

00:24:31.170 --> 00:24:33.340
THE UNSEEN STORY...

00:24:33.340 --> 00:24:35.260
EVEN WHEN WERE LOST...

00:24:35.260 --> 00:24:37.640
...CAN'T WE BELIEVE...

00:24:37.680 --> 00:24:40.470
...THAT WE CAN STILL DO?

00:24:47.660 --> 00:24:56.430
Preview

00:24:48.250 --> 00:24:50.560
The poison of the Curare is stolen.

00:24:50.590 --> 00:24:52.150
Who is the cursed blowgun after?

00:24:53.250 --> 00:24:55.230
A mysterious, masked man dances...

00:24:55.920 --> 00:24:58.950
Sensing danger, the Q class assembles at Kazuma's school.

00:24:57.540 --> 00:25:06.320
Right after this. Kyuu breaks down!

00:24:59.680 --> 00:25:01.910
But poison arrows are launched right in front of them.

00:25:02.810 --> 00:25:04.280
Who is the chosen sacrifice?

00:25:05.060 --> 00:25:06.290
There is one answer!

00:25:10.650 --> 00:25:12.940
Don't cry, Kyuu.

00:25:15.190 --> 00:25:16.800
I said: don't cry!

00:25:16.820 --> 00:25:19.260
I never thought that would happen!
